{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6d44dcaa0323af78baa85398d647c65f40cf31c7012904203f079b77f4d02374", "ja": "（亜美が新しい衣装を試着している。\n今回の役柄は、あの昔話の主人公？　だが……）", "zh": "（亚美正在试穿新服装。\n这次的角色，是那个民间故事的主人公？可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "b68d47184e164842dbdd7c5d0cfe0b27372e44b5718a4571a059efb139eff330", "ja": "見て見て、兄ちゃーん！\n鬼の女王になった桃太郎の衣装だよ！", "zh": "你看你看，哥哥——！\n这是变成了鬼女王的桃太郎的衣服哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
