{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e2921ab5f33b72c86364cd67e9d38e1bc3947f4404aa7e6ec1c504ab3082bf63", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。ポップなデザインで、\n亜美にピッタリだな。髪型も変えたのか？", "zh": "啊，当然。这个设计很活泼，和亚美特别相配。连发型也换了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "3700320eb37a95a5ed1071e96972d484d20d71e31745826d3ad48c96a90a0659", "ja": "おっ、気づいた？　頭のツノが目立つように、\n下で結んでみたんだ～♪", "zh": "哦，注意到了？为了让头顶的角更显眼，我试着在下面扎起来了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "ad3b3b27a6eb21c67287199618756f8aa8eb30b4e029fc8597a3d99eb5ceba99", "ja": "いや～でも、こんなにかわいい鬼がいたら、\nなんでもしてあげたくなっちゃうよね！", "zh": "不过啊～要是有这么可爱的鬼，真的会忍不住想为她做任何事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ed13629e67f7e6d3dbc8bbe3c875a47290806d56deb8aef73866b964cd02284b", "ja": "まあ、なんでもっていうのはあれだけど、\nかわいい衣装だと思うよ。", "zh": "虽然说什么都答应有点夸张，\n但确实是很可爱的服装哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "f3dc35fb1e1227c792ff724acf9fd5283646de634681a6082474daa9a69fef62", "ja": "でしょでしょ～♪　じゃあ、\n鬼の亜美の欲しいもの、全部くれるよね？", "zh": "对吧对吧～♪ 那你会把鬼之亚美想要的东西全部给我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "d0880f1d356a6ab5e791d8eda5d75c1899919475cfa7f19fe6beed80c6acf43a", "ja": "お団子でしょ、新しいパーカーでしょー。それから、\n携帯ゲーム機とー、かわいい時計とー、あとあと……。", "zh": "团子对吧，还有新卫衣——然后是掌上游戏机、可爱的手表，还有还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1009_p", "source_sha256": "aafe0aa9a554c0cc245418d54e93216de4422c2bef8903768f529227c8af7dbe", "ja": "こら、鬼と関係のないものばっかりじゃないか。\nというか、なんでもするとか言ってないからな？", "zh": "喂，怎么尽是些和鬼没关系的东西啊。  \n再说了，我也没说什么都可以做吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "2bbaec08f68617dc37420b6870844af608f6024e34f765f479ad05dff8f6e49d", "ja": "えー！　せっかくぷりちーな鬼になったのにー！\n兄ちゃんのケチ～！　なんかちょうだい～！", "zh": "诶——！人家好不容易才变成可爱的鬼的说——！\n哥哥真小气～！给人家点什么嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "3f86aa1dd27e811fb5f25a0c9184dda57b9200e8402dc878984451f4c03ce606", "ja": "鬼の女王、アミサマの言うこと聞かないと、\n劇場でいーっぱいワルさしちゃうぞーっ！", "zh": "要是不听鬼之女王亚美大人的话，\n我就要在剧场里大干坏事啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1012_p", "source_sha256": "76b69697b7859267a2f231a6eb7a82de8f9ed9c5f174e8de9de0c4960595abe0", "ja": "それは、いつものことのような……。\nまあ、仕事を頑張ってくれるなら、考えてもいいけど。", "zh": "这不是一直都这样吗……。\n嗯，如果你愿意好好工作，我倒是可以考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "6a338ff6266bcf2c54d41412e229a64271d64708df9a2045cb0492a024c93442", "ja": "ホント！？　やった～！　鬼になった亜美の魅力に、\n兄ちゃんもカンパーイってことだね！", "zh": "真的！？太好了～！这下哥哥也要为变成鬼的亚美的魅力干杯啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "3dc42da811ed1ba4aaddc4f89600ee8fe9b6996946856e33cc10e541791560df", "ja": "こうなったら、兄ちゃんだけじゃなくて、\n世界中のみんなもメロメロにしちゃうかんね！", "zh": "既然都这样了，那就不只是让兄长，连全世界的人也都为我神魂颠倒吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0234_1015_p", "source_sha256": "be0dda95f6698467036c611f78a8781a084248c8c0cf964e5806795b48b347aa", "ja": "ずいぶん大きく出たな……。\nでも、今の亜美なら、できるかもしれないな。", "zh": "这口气可真不小啊……  \n不过，如果是现在的亜美，说不定真的能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
